      <title>Schneider’s $23 Billion Bet on PTC Is Seriously Aggressive</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-05/schneider-s-23-billion-bet-on-ptc-is-seriously-aggressive</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d776d750d8f07272e2b239fd</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 14:08:16 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The financial mood is tense, borrowing costs are rising and dealmaking has been quieter since the summer. But Europe has a cohort of companies that are benefiting from the rise of artificial intelligence, and their animal spirits are stirring. Enter Schneider Electric SE with a surprising and very aggressive $23 billion deal to buy S&amp;P 500 software firm PTC Inc.</description>
